Read a setting the game's ddraw.ini lacks as in the one sfall comes with

Scripts read ddraw.ini as it is where sfall is installed, with every setting in it. FO2tweaks took the -1 of a missing DamageFormula for a wrong one, wrote a ddraw.ini of its own and asked for the game to be started again, its damage changes off until then. sfall_ddraw_defaults.h holds sfall 4.5.1.1's artifacts/ddraw.ini.
---
